    "title": "<p>Diseases with histiocytic, lymphocytic, and eosinophilic patterns: cytopathological features, differential cytopathology in bronchoalveolar lavage (BAL), and ancillary testing {27134484; 9869825; 22550210; 26876879; 17497041; 33462627; 24261323}</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Marianne Engels",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 701.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"936\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Specific disease</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Cytopathological features</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Differential cytopathology in BAL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Ancillary testing</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Silicosis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Silica-laden macrophages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Organizing pneumonia</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Increase of lymphocytes, foamy macrophages</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Lymphocytes &gt;&nbsp;25%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Atypical mycobacterial infection</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Macrophages filled with acid-fast rods</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ziehl&ndash;Neelsen and auramine stains; PCR; culture</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Lipoid pneumonia</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Lipid-laden macrophages, Oil&nbsp;Red&nbsp;O+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Oil&nbsp;Red&nbsp;O</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>EVALI</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lipid-laden macrophages, Oil&nbsp;Red&nbsp;O+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Oil&nbsp;Red&nbsp;O</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Amiodarone-induced lung toxicity </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Macrophages with fine clear vacuoles</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Oil&nbsp;Red&nbsp;O</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pulmonary alveolar proteinosis </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Macrophages filled with PASD-positive material; cholesterol crystals</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">PASD</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Diffuse alveolar haemorrhage</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Haemosiderin-laden macrophages, intact red blood cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Iron stain</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Lymphocytic interstitial pneumonia</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Increase of lymphocytes</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphocytes &gt;&nbsp;15%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Hypersensitivity pneumonitis </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Increase of lymphocytes, foamy macrophages, mast cells, plasma cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Lymphocytes &gt;&nbsp;50%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Sarcoidosis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Increase of lymphocytes</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphocytes &gt;&nbsp;15%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Elevated CD4:CD8 ratio</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Beh&ccedil;et disease</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Slight increase of lymphocytes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Elevated CD4:CD8 ratio</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Malignant lymphoma, low-grade</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphocytosis, mostly small lymphoid cells, increase of plasma cells, some multinucleated histiocytes</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphocytes &gt;&nbsp;15%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Flow cytometry; ICC may assist in some cases</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Eosinophilic pneumonia</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Marked eosinophilia</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Eosinophils &gt;&nbsp;25%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Bronchial asthma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Slight eosinophilia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Eosinophils &gt;&nbsp;1%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Allergic bronchopulmonary aspergillosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Slight eosinophilia, fungal structures</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Eosinophils &gt;&nbsp;1%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Eosinophilic granulomatosis with polyangiitis (Churg&ndash;Strauss disease)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Slight eosinophilia, histiocytes, granuloma, blood</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Eosinophils &gt;&nbsp;1%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Parasitic and fungal infections</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 262.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"350\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Fungal structures or fragments of parasites</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Eosinophils &gt;&nbsp;1%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.85pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"198\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Methenamine silver and PASD stains; ICC; PCR</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">EVALI, e-cigarette or vaping product use&ndash;associated lung injury.</p>",
